  <Thumbnail>8b41b316-fcc7-4a77-911f-44e87b31c1fc</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="23-11-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (charts are confusing lacking a lot of detail.  it is not clear what all the various controls relate to. no pixel layout.  made best guess)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="07-01-22" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added 68 and 117 channel modes in line with latest charts in response to manufacturer request (requested 48 and 117 - assumed 48 is mistake)." Version="4" />
  <History Date="11-01-22" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="5" />
  <History Date="31-07-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from ACME PIXEL LINE IP (STROBE 3 IP)" Version="6" />
  <History Date="04-08-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="7" />
  <History Date="16-01-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with latest documentation (adds control channel to majority of modes)" Version="8" />
  <History Date="12-10-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added LED Pixel Order control functions/macros in response to manufacturer request." Version="9" />
  <History Date="29-10-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added 68 channel mode in line with latest charts in response to manufacturer request (note confirmed numerous reserved channels are correct.  mode numbers are missing)" Version="10" />
  <History Date="30-03-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Adds multi-part patch option for mode 9." Version="11" />
